1
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:25,640
YAMU!

2
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,377
YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!

3
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:29,780
YAMU!

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,540
Your moves!

5
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:39,320
It's time to duel!

6
00:01:01,740 --> 00:01:03,240
Make your move!

7
00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:05,660
All right, quit pressuring me!

8
00:01:05,820 --> 00:01:06,879
This isn't so bad.

9
00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:10,477
Now Joey's got a monster in
his corner with 3,000 points.

10
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:13,619
So if he attacks Maric
directly, he'll win the duel.

11
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:15,300
It's not that easy, Taya.

12
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,200
Remember, Maric gave that monster to
Joey, which can mean only one thing.

13
00:01:20,460 --> 00:01:22,048
Maric wants Joey to attack.

14
00:01:22,260 --> 00:01:25,240
It's all part of his
strategy to eliminate Joey.

15
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:28,557
I can't let Maric win and
advance to the finals.

16
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:31,522
Then I'll never rescue
Mai from the Shadow Realm.

17
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:34,346
In fact, I'll be trapped
right there with her.

18
00:01:34,720 --> 00:01:36,980
Come on, show me the...

19
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:39,140
So much for that card.

20
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:40,400
What do I do now?

21
00:01:40,760 --> 00:01:43,080
I can't attack Merrick with Lava Golem.

22
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:45,677
I'm sure that's exactly
what he wants me to do.

23
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:49,172
Why else would that freak give
me such a powerful monster?

24
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:52,460
Lava Golem belongs to you, little Joey.

25
00:01:52,940 --> 00:01:56,297
Consider it a gift with
one small drawback.

26
00:01:56,380 --> 00:02:00,260
With each turn, you lose 700 life points.

27
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:03,417
I can't just let this thing
melt away my life points.

28
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:06,897
And if I hold on to it, that's
exactly what it's gonna do.

29
00:02:06,980 --> 00:02:11,240
So I better take my chances and
use it against Marek. All right.

30
00:02:11,660 --> 00:02:14,740
I think it's only fair to
use the gift you gave me.

31
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:16,110
Excellent.

32
00:02:16,300 --> 00:02:21,220
I must say, that's the most intelligent
thing you've said this entire duel.

33
00:02:21,480 --> 00:02:22,337
Watch yourself.

34
00:02:22,420 --> 00:02:24,773
I guess you finally came to your senses.

35
00:02:25,260 --> 00:02:27,900
Or, perhaps you realize the truth.

36
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:31,320
There's absolutely no way
you can win this. What?

37
00:02:32,060 --> 00:02:35,600
Every pathway leads to
the Shadow Realm. No way.

38
00:02:35,740 --> 00:02:39,257
Don't listen to a single twisted
word that creep says, Joey.

39
00:02:39,340 --> 00:02:41,180
He's trying to psych you out.

40
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:43,237
Wheeler's in quite a predicament.

41
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:45,673
If he attacks, Merrick will strike back.

42
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:48,231
But if he doesn't, he'll lose life points.

43
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:49,320
It's over.

44
00:02:49,620 --> 00:02:52,617
For once, you and I are
in agreement, little Joey.

45
00:02:52,700 --> 00:02:56,520
The moment you attack me,
it's all over for you!

46
00:02:56,780 --> 00:02:59,237
Then I guess I'll have to take my chances.

47
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:00,150
Attack!

48
00:03:00,233 --> 00:03:02,060
Wait, are you sure about this?

49
00:03:02,260 --> 00:03:03,540
Too late now!

50
00:03:04,020 --> 00:03:06,240
I can't watch, is it over yet?

51
00:03:08,340 --> 00:03:11,480
Time to block your attack with this!

52
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:13,880
Reveal Tramp!

53
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:16,620
This card, known as Relieve Monster,

54
00:03:16,900 --> 00:03:20,137
allows me to return one
of my monsters to my hand.

55
00:03:20,220 --> 00:03:21,480
Once that happens,

56
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:26,237
I can replace that creature with any
four-star monster I'm holding in my hand.

57
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:28,160
Really swift move, Einstein,

58
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:32,500
because you don't have any monsters
to return to your hand. Hold on.

59
00:03:32,620 --> 00:03:36,973
You're forgetting about the Plasma Eel
attached to Joey's Panther Warrior.

60
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:40,180
Plasma Eel, return to me!

61
00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:45,740
And since it's a four-star monster,
I can bring it back in defense mode!

62
00:03:50,820 --> 00:03:55,380
Of course you remember my Plasma
Eel's special ability, don't you?

63
00:03:55,620 --> 00:03:58,680
It can't be destroyed in battle. So what?

64
00:03:58,860 --> 00:04:02,360
So, your monsters, on the
other hand, are not so lucky.

65
00:04:02,660 --> 00:04:04,240
Now go, help-o-emma.

66
00:04:04,480 --> 00:04:08,140
Say goodbye to a random
card from your hand.

67
00:04:09,200 --> 00:04:11,440
Are you done? Not quite.

68
00:04:11,820 --> 00:04:13,200
There's one more thing.

69
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:14,880
Just look.

70
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:18,677
That lava golem of yours
is beginning to melt now.

71
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:21,620
Costing you 700 life points

72
00:04:26,820 --> 00:04:28,380
It's all over

73
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:34,104
Marek's dark side has
beckoned the shadows again

74
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:40,717
I fear this madness won't end For
with every soul he feeds to the

75
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:46,700
shadows The evil within my brother
grows stronger Get ready My move

76
00:04:48,020 --> 00:04:49,220
Machine Duplication?

77
00:04:49,440 --> 00:04:53,800
This is exactly the card I
needed to finish this pool off.

78
00:04:54,300 --> 00:04:55,500
Hang in there, Joey.

79
00:04:55,740 --> 00:04:57,517
You're still ahead of this jerk.

80
00:04:57,600 --> 00:05:01,077
Your friend's life points may be
greater than mine for the moment,

81
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,631
but that won't last long.

82
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:03,819
How do you figure?

83
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:06,980
Go, Machine Duplication!

84
00:05:07,320 --> 00:05:09,460
Turn one heel into three!

85
00:05:10,100 --> 00:05:10,930
Ah, man!

86
00:05:11,020 --> 00:05:14,432
Now he can lower the attack
points of more on my monsters.

87
00:05:15,580 --> 00:05:18,080
Now you're beginning to catch on!

88
00:05:18,380 --> 00:05:19,940
Go Plasma Eels!

89
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:22,560
Drain his monsters of points!

90
00:05:23,620 --> 00:05:25,920
And his body of strength!

91
00:05:28,780 --> 00:05:30,280
Stay strong, Joey!

92
00:05:30,520 --> 00:05:32,740
You remember the rules, don't you?

93
00:05:32,980 --> 00:05:36,160
When your monsters are
damaged, you lose energy!

94
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:40,260
And before long you'll be too
weak to move, let alone duel!

95
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:46,720
Is that all you got, Merrick?

96
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:49,740
Come on, this is nothing.

97
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:54,037
It's gonna take more than that to
keep me down, you frizzy-haired freak.

98
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:58,840
Then I shall place one card face down
and let you go, if you can stand.

99
00:05:59,380 --> 00:06:02,204
Things aren't looking so
good for Joey up there.

100
00:06:02,540 --> 00:06:03,370
She's right.

101
00:06:03,660 --> 00:06:06,337
Merrick's shadow duel is
really wearing Joey down.

102
00:06:06,420 --> 00:06:09,297
And if he loses, he goes
straight to the Shadow Realm.

103
00:06:09,380 --> 00:06:10,210
Come on, Joey.

104
00:06:10,420 --> 00:06:12,500
Whatever you do, don't lose hope.

105
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:20,137
I gotta put out this flaming monster of
mine before I lose any more life points.

106
00:06:20,220 --> 00:06:23,317
But I only have one card in my
hand, and it can't help me now.

107
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:28,047
If I don't do something soon, Marek's
gonna win and advance to the final round.

108
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:30,497
Which means the whole world's in trouble.

109
00:06:30,580 --> 00:06:33,345
And I promised Yugi I
wouldn't let that happen.

110
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:37,937
If you think I'm gonna let you win this,
then you're even dumber than you look.

111
00:06:38,020 --> 00:06:40,491
Now, feast your crazy eyes on this, Marek.

112
00:06:40,860 --> 00:06:43,742
All right, heart of the
cards, show me some love.

113
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:46,140
This is it! Come on!

114
00:06:47,320 --> 00:06:48,697
Guildford the Lightning!

115
00:06:48,780 --> 00:06:51,251
This guy can kick some serious Maric butt.

116
00:06:51,460 --> 00:06:53,237
There's just one little problem.

117
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:56,037
I gotta sacrifice three
monsters to summon him.

118
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:59,944
Thanks to his plasma eels, my
monsters are tied up at the moment.

119
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:03,553
So as long as those eels stick
around, I can't sacrifice.

120
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:07,238
That gives me an idea, but
it's gonna take some luck.

121
00:07:07,900 --> 00:07:10,020
I'm glad I'm not in your shoes,

122
00:07:10,200 --> 00:07:12,977
cause you're in for some
hurt thanks to my magic card.

123
00:07:13,060 --> 00:07:16,337
It's called Graceful Dice, and
it's about to change my luck,

124
00:07:16,420 --> 00:07:19,777
because I can use it to raise the
strength of any monster I choose.

125
00:07:19,860 --> 00:07:20,690
Oh, yeah.

126
00:07:20,773 --> 00:07:25,097
And I've decided to use my card to increase
the attack points of your Plasma Eel.

127
00:07:25,180 --> 00:07:28,800
Once that happens, your machine
duplication goes buh-bye,

128
00:07:28,980 --> 00:07:30,745
and so do your other two eels.

129
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:33,621
Excellent dueling strategy, Joey.

130
00:07:33,960 --> 00:07:38,077
Since your magic card only works on
monsters with 500 attack points or less,

131
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:40,454
Graceful Dice was just a card I needed.

132
00:07:40,860 --> 00:07:42,260
Come on, big bucks.

133
00:07:45,380 --> 00:07:48,100
If I get a two or more, you're toast!

134
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:53,687
According to my math,
six is higher than two.

135
00:07:53,900 --> 00:07:58,980
That means your Plasma Eel's points increase
now by six times its original strength,

136
00:07:59,220 --> 00:08:03,980
which means your Machine Duplication
Magic Card no longer works on it. Later!

137
00:08:05,620 --> 00:08:08,180
I bet you know what happens next, Marek.

138
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:14,820
My Lava Golem and my Rocket
Warrior are free from your eels.

139
00:08:15,380 --> 00:08:16,210
So,

140
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:18,857
now I can sacrifice all
three of my monsters

141
00:08:18,940 --> 00:08:21,411
to bring out my ultimate fighting machine.

142
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:30,900
Meet Gilbert the Lightning.

143
00:08:44,760 --> 00:08:47,040
Say hello to my pal, Guilford.

144
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:50,957
He's about to crush any hopes you
had of winning this duel, Marek.

145
00:08:51,040 --> 00:08:54,077
So how does it feel to be
staring into the face of defeat?

146
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:54,990
Oh, yeah.

147
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:57,217
Way to rock the ultimate comeback, man.

148
00:08:57,300 --> 00:08:58,720
Now finish this guy off.

149
00:08:59,040 --> 00:09:00,860
We knew you could do it.

150
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:04,835
I must have missed the joke, Chuckles.

151
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:07,297
Let me fill you in.

152
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:12,040
When you used your magic card on my
Plasma Eel, you raised its attack points.

153
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,460
So thanks to you,

154
00:09:13,640 --> 00:09:17,699
my Plasma Eel is now more powerful
than your Guilford, the Lightning.

155
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:26,380
It looks like your strategy backfired,
giving me the advantage, little Joey. Wrong!

156
00:09:27,220 --> 00:09:30,960
Do you think I'd be dumb
enough to let that happen? Yes!

157
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:33,277
It looks as if Merrick thought wrong,

158
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:38,125
because the special ability of Guilford
destroys every one of Merrick's monsters.

159
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:40,300
It's time to take him down, Joey.

160
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:41,740
It's over.

161
00:09:42,140 --> 00:09:46,081
Guilford, show this wannabe what
your special ability is all about.

162
00:09:46,300 --> 00:09:48,829
Wipe out his eel with
your lightning sword.

163
00:09:56,920 --> 00:09:57,960
But how?

164
00:09:58,140 --> 00:10:00,737
My plasma eel's special
ability prevents it

165
00:10:00,820 --> 00:10:03,277
from being destroyed in
battle by any monster.

166
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:05,420
Someone's not paying attention.

167
00:10:05,860 --> 00:10:07,400
Let me make this easy.

168
00:10:07,780 --> 00:10:10,780
Your eel's not the only
one with a special ability.

169
00:10:10,920 --> 00:10:15,197
And my Guilford's special ability destroys
every monster you have on the field.

170
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:18,751
I guess you shouldn't have
skipped class that day, Merrick.

171
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:20,300
But don't worry.

172
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:22,977
School's back in session
starting right now.

173
00:10:23,060 --> 00:10:25,260
And Professor Wheeler's in the house.

174
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:28,400
Guilford, teach this kid
a lesson the hard way.

175
00:10:31,780 --> 00:10:35,020
Attack Marek's light points directly Ha!

176
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:40,720
You'd better think again Reveal
the face-down card Nightmare Mirror

177
00:10:43,180 --> 00:10:44,010
Disappointed?

178
00:10:44,280 --> 00:10:47,520
Upset because my Nightmare
Mirror blocked your attack?

179
00:10:47,940 --> 00:10:50,620
Well, I'm afraid it's much worse than that

180
00:10:52,500 --> 00:10:56,280
Take a close look at the
terrified image in my mirror

181
00:10:57,060 --> 00:10:57,940
It's you,

182
00:10:58,140 --> 00:11:03,000
the new target of your monster's attack
Now feel the wrath of your own creature,

183
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:04,494
Guilford the Lightning

184
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:10,720
And I escaped without a scratch

185
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:17,700
You, on the other hand,

186
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:23,457
are 1,000 light points weaker And mere
steps away from the Shadow Realm There's

187
00:11:23,540 --> 00:11:28,500
only one small price I have to pay and
that's to discard one card to my graveyard.

188
00:11:29,060 --> 00:11:32,460
And this is the perfect
card for me to part with.

189
00:11:33,220 --> 00:11:34,050
For now,

190
00:11:34,133 --> 00:11:38,840
did you honestly think that you could
take control of this duel away from me?

191
00:11:39,100 --> 00:11:41,480
This is a shadow game, you fool!

192
00:11:42,820 --> 00:11:45,460
Which means that I make all the rules.

193
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:48,075
I don't like the sound of this at all.

194
00:11:48,220 --> 00:11:50,102
Merrick must be up to something.

195
00:11:50,760 --> 00:11:53,000
Play that Egyptian god card, Merrick.

196
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:54,920
I end my turn.

197
00:11:55,760 --> 00:11:58,477
He doesn't have any cards
in his hand or on the field.

198
00:11:58,560 --> 00:12:01,736
So if I can get through this
next turn, I got it made.

199
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:03,960
Are you ready? My move.

200
00:12:09,340 --> 00:12:11,281
Enough with the laughing already.

201
00:12:11,380 --> 00:12:13,439
Just play a card and let's move on.

202
00:12:14,580 --> 00:12:16,800
You'll regret those words, you fool.

203
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:22,180
For I'm about to eliminate you from this
duel once and for all with Ra. With Ra?

204
00:12:22,560 --> 00:12:24,317
His Egyptian god card.

205
00:12:24,400 --> 00:12:29,341
But there's no way Mera can summon a monster
as powerful as the winged dragon of Ra.

206
00:12:29,500 --> 00:12:31,147
He has nothing to sacrifice.

207
00:12:31,980 --> 00:12:35,420
Seto, now's your chance to
find out the weaknesses of Ra.

208
00:12:36,460 --> 00:12:39,166
Everything's working out
according to my plan.

209
00:12:39,540 --> 00:12:41,952
Now that Wheeler served as my guinea pig,

210
00:12:42,100 --> 00:12:45,200
I can watch Ra in action
and learn how to defeat it.

211
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:48,617
I may have been able to read
the Egyptian text on the card,

212
00:12:48,700 --> 00:12:50,171
but reading is one thing,

213
00:12:50,280 --> 00:12:51,317
witnessing is another.

214
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:53,780
When I first saw the ancient writing,

215
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:57,002
I knew that the winged
dragon of Ra was powerful.

216
00:12:57,400 --> 00:13:01,160
But seeing Marek summon it
was much more useful to me.

217
00:13:09,900 --> 00:13:11,400
Behold, my great beast!

218
00:13:12,260 --> 00:13:15,980
The most powerful of all
the Egyptian god monsters!

219
00:13:16,920 --> 00:13:20,820
Now, like the dragon of Ra, end this duel!

220
00:13:23,980 --> 00:13:29,417
I need to see Marek's Egyptian God
card one more time So when I face him

221
00:13:29,500 --> 00:13:35,400
in the next round I'll be prepared to
crush it I activate the magic card,

222
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:41,600
Monster Reborn To bring back Ra

223
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:47,920
Show yourself my great beast of the sky

224
00:14:00,060 --> 00:14:03,840
This is the last monster
you'll ever see, little Joey.

225
00:14:04,720 --> 00:14:07,367
But Merrick's monster
has zero attack points.

226
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:09,400
What kind of strategy is that?

227
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:14,137
Raw takes on the attack points of the
monsters that are sacrificed to summon it.

228
00:14:14,220 --> 00:14:19,040
But since Merrick didn't make any
sacrifices, his monster has no attack points.

229
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:24,320
First, I'll activate Ra's ability of
instant attack so it can attack now.

230
00:14:24,620 --> 00:14:27,385
But that's just the
beginning of your troubles.

231
00:14:30,400 --> 00:14:32,165
Someone wanna fill me in here?

232
00:14:32,340 --> 00:14:34,281
It looks like Ra is transforming.

233
00:14:37,340 --> 00:14:40,160
To hold the true form of Ra!

234
00:14:41,300 --> 00:14:42,130
What?

235
00:14:42,213 --> 00:14:43,817
Tell me what's going on here.

236
00:14:43,900 --> 00:14:47,497
Because where I'm from, giant
flaming birds are not a good thing.

237
00:14:47,580 --> 00:14:48,957
So give it to me straight.

238
00:14:49,040 --> 00:14:53,520
My winged dragon has taken on
the form of Egyptian god Phoenix.

239
00:14:54,020 --> 00:14:56,280
In this mode, Ra is unstoppable.

240
00:14:57,040 --> 00:14:58,320
It's awesome.

241
00:14:59,100 --> 00:15:01,500
Yes, and soon it will belong to me.

242
00:15:02,180 --> 00:15:04,040
Now my beast is ready.

243
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:06,600
Ready to feed you to the shadows.

244
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:15,617
I can't stand not knowing
